# A class under an IES4 class that the mapping file has no entry for. A check rejects it.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ies: <http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#> .
@prefix ont: <http://example.com/local-ontology#> .

ont:Hovercraft a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ies:Entity .
